<title>USA: IPO PRICING- Overland prices at top range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING- Overland prices at top range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		  Overland Data Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $10</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range		$8 - $10</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			3,000,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	   Jefferies &amp; Co Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The company raised the number of shares proposed for its planned initial public offering to three million shares from 2.7 million shares previously.</p>
